WEBVTT

00:00:29.942 --> 00:00:35.907
high school dropout rates increase,
as do crime and prison rates.

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:38.826
And I was no different.

00:00:39.786 --> 00:00:42.789
I grew up in Georgia without my father.

00:00:44.248 --> 00:00:45.792
My mother raised me.

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:49.462
And let me tell you
something about my mom.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:54.509
Every day before school, she would look
me in the eyes and say to me,

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:59.138
"You are tall, dark and handsome."

00:00:59.138 --> 00:01:01.724
(Laughter)